They worked for me three years ago, but not now.

00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:37,520
Okay, so somebody who is ER and or PR

00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:40,160
or HER2 positive negative,

00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,640
or HER2 positive cancer,

00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:47,440
you know, you're trying to get your estrogen levels down.

00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:50,360
So you want your estrogen levels to be down

00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,840
because you don't want your estrogen levels

00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:56,400
to be blocking the estrogen beta receptor.

00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:59,280
So that's the whole idea.

00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:02,000
So it's a kind of a catch 22.

00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,480
If my estrogen levels then go down,

00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:09,480
that could be better to help my body kill the cancer.

00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,800
