00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:15,560
that could be bad because I'm gonna end up with hot flashes.

00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:18,720
So it's this balancing act with somebody with cancer.

00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:22,840
Now, if you're cancers in a relative state of remission again,

00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:25,440
then you could use some natural things

00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:28,480
to help balance estrogen so that you don't have

00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:33,480
the side effects of low estrogen, aka hot flashes and such.

00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:37,440
If that's the case,

00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:39,920
hey, my cancer's in relative state of remission

00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:44,920
and I'm using like cohosh to try to balance my hormones,

00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,520
but it's not working now.

00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:50,960
Well, a couple things could be going on.

00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:55,960
Remember, some of the brands of supplements

