which a lot of these companies,

00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:41,400
like I think the Carlisle brand,

00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:44,480
which is kind of an off cheaper brand,

00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:48,640
it could be all over the board as far as what's actually

00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,680
in the capsules.

00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:54,120
So, A, you could switch to a different brand,

00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:58,640
you could have a bunch of that try taking a higher dose,

00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:01,280
but again, it would be based upon where you're at

